@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    ``wait.wait_exponential_jitter`` gains a ``min`` argument that sets a floor on
+    the wait, matching ``wait_exponential``. The ``max``, ``jitter`` and ``min``
+    arguments now also accept a ``datetime.timedelta``, as well as numbers of seconds.
diff --git a/tenacity/wait.py b/tenacity/wait.py
